---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Data Coverage"
description: "What xGO lookups can and cannot tell you: supported data types, the North American Numbering Plan footprint, and the coverage considerations for each product."
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import arrow, dot, chip %}

<section class="page-hero page-hero--crumbs" aria-labelledby="page-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		{%- set crumbs = [{ label: "Resources" }] %}
		{%- set crumbCurrent = "Data Coverage" %}
		{%- include "partials/crumbs.njk" %}
		<div class="pair pair--end page-hero__grid">
			<div class="pair__copy pair__copy--main">
				<p class="label label--ink">Data coverage</p>
				<h1 id="page-title" class="h1 h1--xl">Know what your lookup can tell you.</h1>
				<p class="lede--hero measure">Phone intelligence is only useful when you understand what the data represents.</p>
				<p class="text measure">Explore xGO's supported data types, geographic scope, and important coverage considerations.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="pair__aside card">
				<p class="label">Geographic coverage</p>
				<p class="big-mono">+1</p>
				<p class="lede--sm">xGO's initial phone intelligence products are focused on the North American Numbering Plan.</p>
				<p class="card__text card__text--sm">Specific field availability can vary by number, data source, and product.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line section--mist" aria-labelledby="table-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="split">
			<p class="label split__label">By product</p>
			<h2 id="table-title" class="h2 split__body">Data coverage by product.</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="table-card mt-lg">
			<div class="table-card__scroll">
				<table class="cov-table" aria-labelledby="table-title">
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th scope="col" class="cov-table__th label label--ink">Product</th>
							<th scope="col" class="cov-table__th label label--ink">Initial geography</th>
							<th scope="col" class="cov-table__th label label--ink">Coverage considerations</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr>
							<th scope="row" class="cov-table__td cov-table__product"><a class="cov-table__link" href="/products/caller-name-lookup/">Caller Name Lookup</a></th>
							<td class="cov-table__td"><span class="cov-table__geo">{{ dot() }}NANP numbers</span></td>
							<td class="cov-table__td cov-table__note">Caller-name records may be missing or outdated</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<th scope="row" class="cov-table__td cov-table__product"><a class="cov-table__link" href="/products/carrier-lookup/">Carrier Lookup</a></th>
							<td class="cov-table__td"><span class="cov-table__geo">{{ dot() }}NANP numbers</span></td>
							<td class="cov-table__td cov-table__note">Available identifiers depend on lookup response</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<th scope="row" class="cov-table__td cov-table__product"><a class="cov-table__link" href="/products/lrn-lookup/">LRN Lookup</a></th>
							<td class="cov-table__td"><span class="cov-table__geo">{{ dot() }}NANP numbers</span></td>
							<td class="cov-table__td cov-table__note">Requires supported routing data</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<th scope="row" class="cov-table__td cov-table__product"><a class="cov-table__link" href="/products/ghostverify/">GhostVerify</a>{{ chip("Coming soon", "chip--sm", true) }}</th>
							<td class="cov-table__td"><span class="cov-table__geo text-slate">{{ dot("dot--hollow") }}Carrier-dependent</span></td>
							<td class="cov-table__td cov-table__note">Requires participating networks and eligible devices</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="legend">
			<span class="legend-item">{{ dot() }}Initial coverage defined</span>
			<span class="legend-item">{{ dot("dot--hollow") }}In development</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line" aria-labelledby="not-title">
	<div class="wrap split">
		<p class="label split__label">Limitations</p>
		<div class="split__body">
			<h2 id="not-title" class="h2">What xGO data does not establish.</h2>
			<ul class="limits">
				<li class="limits__item">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}<span class="limits__text">Caller-name information does not establish legal ownership.</span></li>
				<li class="limits__item">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}<span class="limits__text">LRN information does not prove a number is active.</span></li>
				<li class="limits__item">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}<span class="limits__text">Carrier routing information does not necessarily identify a phone's line type.</span></li>
				<li class="limits__item">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}<span class="limits__text">Silent verification requires an authorized user-device authentication flow.</span>{{ chip("Coming soon", "chip--sm", true) }}</li>
				<li class="limits__item">{{ dot("dot--ink") }}<span class="limits__text">SIM change intelligence is subject to carrier coverage and available history.</span>{{ chip("Coming soon", "chip--sm", true) }}</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

{%- set cta = {
	title: "Have a specific coverage requirement?",
	text: "Contact us to discuss your use case.",
	primary: { label: "Contact xGO", href: "/contact/" },
	secondary: { label: "Explore Products", href: "/products/" }
} %}
{%- include "partials/cta-card.njk" %}
